OL,3,GNEWSAHow the Huntingdon train attack
OL,4,Aunfolded - carriage by carriage
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootballer Jonathan Gjoshe, 22, was on
OL,7,Fthe 18:25 train from Doncaster to
OL,8,FLondon King's Cross on 1 November last
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FJust weeks into his first season at
OL,12,FScunthorpe United, Gjoshe was
OL,13,Ftravelling to his home in London
OL,14,Falongside 150 other passengers.
OL,16,FHe was sitting at a table seat in Coach
OL,17,FJ when a figure appeared over his
OL,18,Fshoulder. The figure, dressed in black,
OL,19,Fwas Anthony Williams, who had boarded
OL,20,Fthe train moments earlier at
OL,21,FPeterborough at 19:26.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
